          </span>
          <h3
            class="_title_c81049"
          >
            Predictable Cost
          </h3>
          <p
            class="_body_c81049"
          >
            Every review reports its exact token usage and USD cost in the comment footer. Set a \`budget_cap_usd\` in \`.lychee.yml\` and Lychee will halt and report a partial result rather than exceeding it. No surprise bills.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article
          class="_card_c81049"
        >
          <span
            aria-hidden="true"
            class="_icon_c81049"
          >
            🗂️
          </span>
          <h3
            class="_title_c81049"
          >
            Map-Reduce for Large PRs
          </h3>
          <p
            class="_body_c81049"
          >
            PRs exceeding 50 changed files don't get skipped or truncated. Lychee partitions them into groups of 10, reviews each group separately, then merges the results into one coherent review. The output contract is identical regardless of PR size.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article
          class="_card_c81049"
